1 0 obj<</Author(womenlovingwonderwoman \(The_Camel_Queen\))/CreationDate(D:20261101010322+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Teen And Up Audiences, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora & Bow \(She-Ra\), Adora & Entrapta \(She-Ra\), Adora & Angella \(She-Ra\), Glimmer & Micah \(She-Ra\), Bow & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Bow/Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Adora & Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner \(She-Ra\), Bow & Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora & Bow & Catra & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), Bow \(She-Ra\), Entrapta \(She-Ra\), Angella \(She-Ra\), Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Micah \(She-Ra\), Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner \(She-Ra\), adoptee trauma, Minor Character Death, Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder - PTSD, Hurt/Comfort, Depression, Anxiety, Adora \(She-Ra\) Needs a Hug, Catra \(She-Ra\) Needs a Hug, bow \(she-ra\) needs a hug, Glimmer Needs a Hug \(She-Ra\), Catra Needs Therapy \(She-Ra\), Bow Is a Good Friend \(She-Ra\), Autistic Entrapta \(She-Ra\), Queen Catra \(She-Ra\), Princess Catra \(She-Ra\), this is a little breather while i write the next installment, some of it will be happier than others, but as bad as things look now it will get worse, and also so much better, adora is a little bit more of a reliable narrator in this, but she's not the only pov, POV Adora \(She-Ra\), pov angella, i also think i gave angella a bad rap in this story so consider this her redemption arc, i love her character i just wanted to critique it, No Archive Warnings Apply, F/F)/ModDate(D:20261101010322+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(come gain your merit)>>
endobj
